  <ferc:OrderNumber id="Tag322" contextRef="C123" unitRef="Pure" decimals="0">21</ferc:OrderNumber>
  <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="Tag323" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNoSpacing"&gt;1 &amp;#8211; None&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNoSpacing"&gt;2 &amp;#8211; Effective January 2, 2026, Bridger Pipeline LLC acquired the crude oil and natural gas midstream assets of Caliber Midstream Partners, LLC. The Caliber assets are comprised of approximately 170 miles of crude oil pipelines, crude oil terminals, and crude oil truck unloads, and approximately 40 miles of natural gas pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;Effective January 1, 2022, Bridger Pipeline LLC entered into a master lease agreement to lease and operate all of the pipeline facilities/assets and transportation capacity of Belle Fourche Pipeline Company and Butte Pipe Line Company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNoSpacing"&gt;3 &amp;#8211; None&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNoSpacing"&gt;4 &amp;#8211; None&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNoSpacing"&gt;5 &amp;#8211; Not Applicable&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
